  "title": "The Shift Toward Open-Weight AI Models",
  "summary": "DeepSeek has surpassed Google and OpenAI in token usage on Vercel while open-weight models now carry a quarter of all tokens at under 10% of total spend, and the numbers reveal a market splitting by role rather than by winner. Premium models are being used more intentionally for high-stakes work while open weights absorb the high-volume base, and that segmentation is a more durable shift than any single benchmark result.",
